{"asset_key":"ep1/env_story_11302180","episode":"ep1","category":"env_story","story_id":"11302180","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1130218001:1":{"text":"오우거도 사막의 강자이긴 하지만... 지금 우리는 누가 이길지 예측을 해야 하잖아?","source_cn":"奥格当然也是沙漠中的强者……但我们现在不是在下注吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFC0C060FCEA54F95","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1130218002:1":{"text":"난 언제나 승패만 생각해. 딜라프처럼 감정적으로 행동하지 않지.","source_cn":"我在下注时只会考虑结局的输赢，而不是像迪拉夫那么感性。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAAFB84EC96831327","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1130218003:1":{"text":"그리고 난 오우거보다는 브루투스를 진심으로 존경해.","source_cn":"而且，相对奥格，我打心里更尊敬布鲁特斯。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x93D337CCC9BB9846","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:蛮血阿伊莎":{"text":"아이샤","source":"蛮血阿伊莎","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":4,"localized_text_count":3,"speaker_count":1}}